## 2. Geospatial Data (`processed-data/`) — Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG) Terms Notice

All administrative boundary datasets in `processed-data/` are **NOT** licensed under the MIT License above.

These datasets are derived from official geospatial data published by **Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG)** of the Republic of Indonesia via:
- Ina-Geoportal: https://tanahair.indonesia.go.id/
- Geoportal BIG: https://geoportal.big.go.id/

All intellectual property rights and copyright over the underlying geospatial data remain **© Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG)**. The processed datasets in this repository are provided free of charge solely for non-commercial, educational, research, and software development convenience, subject to BIG's Terms of Use and applicable Indonesian laws and regulations:

1. **Mandatory Attribution:** You must clearly credit **Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG)** as the data source in any application, publication, map, or derivative work using these boundaries.
2. **No Commercial Resale of Raw Data:** Commercial resale or paid redistribution of the raw or unmodified geospatial dataset is prohibited without prior authorization from Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG).
3. **Legal Status Disclaimer:**
   > *"Data batas yang berstatus indikatif tidak dapat dijadikan referensi hukum."*
   
   (Indicative boundary data cannot be used as a legal reference. Official legal administrative boundaries are governed by applicable Indonesian legislation and Ministry of Home Affairs regulations.)
